            "block_content": "Section 3. The Employer shall continue to provide each employee who is covered under the currently existing life insurance plan with fully paid accidental death benefits for work-related accidental deaths. The amount of coverage is $10,000, unless the surviving spouse or minor children are entitled to benefits under Act 101 of 1976.",
